# Line-ending discipline. Several files in this repo are BYTE-PINNED: the
# E1/E2/E3 sentinels hash the exact reviewed bytes (python/underseal.py,
# python/underseal.pin.json, cordis.patch.yml, cordis.pin.json, the SKILL.md
# body). Git must never rewrite them to CRLF on checkout, or the sentinels
# fail closed on Windows clones.
#
# `eol=lf` here overrides core.autocrlf for the whole tree: text files stay LF
# in the repository AND in every working copy, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-pinned artifacts (redundant with the global rule; kept explicit so a
# future edit to the rule above cannot silently un-protect them).
python/underseal.py text eol=lf
python/underseal_adapter.py text eol=lf
python/underseal.pin.json text eol=lf
cordis.patch.yml text eol=lf
cordis.pin.json text eol=lf
skills/underseal-delegation/SKILL.md text eol=lf
